sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scanner
  participant A as Tickets API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  S->>A: POST /v1/check-ins (signed QR)
  A->>D: verify token and atomically mark CHECKED_IN
  alt first valid scan
    D-->>A: check-in created
    A-->>S: CHECKED_IN
  else already checked in
    D-->>A: existing check-in
    A-->>S: ALREADY_CHECKED_IN + permitted ticket info
  end
